    "name": "Ashen Dungeon",
    "steam_appid": 3612160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/769c4d58f9c7f0057b6124a06c69b20f.avif?t=1755678732\" width=616 height=288 /></span>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Dungeon</i> is a <strong>turn-based strategy RPG</strong> where players lead an <strong>expedition team</strong> to explore dungeons, gather resources, craft equipment, and engage in tactical battles against enemies.<br>The combat system combines the unpredictability of dice rolls with the strategic use of skills, offering a unique and engaging gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Story &amp; Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where hope has vanished.<br>Chaos reigns. On the day the sky turned crimson, order collapsed, and trust among people was replaced by fear.<br>For reasons unknown, the skin of all mortals began to harden, and in their panic, they turned against one another.<br>You must gather those who still hold the will to return to their former selves, lead an expedition, and carve a new destiny.<br>Every choice you make will shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Expedition Management</strong> \u2013 Recruit and grow your units to form a unique, customized expedition team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/2ae444f8121545a603e5717c7a619c29.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover dangers and rewards as you delve into mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a98e90e152f02a79d8da6aa27731157a.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Secure your survival through lumbering, mining, and item crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a12ee816a88ea576b8b1134438c8797d.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in unpredictable, dice-based tactical battles that demand strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/83b4380bd3c26944a88262397d9d222f.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Development Intent &amp; Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brothers have deeply inspired me with their strategic depth and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 1 person team, I\u2019ve spent several years creating this game as a tribute to these exceptional title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will continue developing Ashen Dungeon to deliver its own unique and compelling experience, and I sincerely welcome your ongoing feedback and support.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/769c4d58f9c7f0057b6124a06c69b20f.avif?t=1755678732\" width=616 height=288 /></span>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Dungeon</i> is a <strong>turn-based strategy RPG</strong> where players lead an <strong>expedition team</strong> to explore dungeons, gather resources, craft equipment, and engage in tactical battles against enemies.<br>The combat system combines the unpredictability of dice rolls with the strategic use of skills, offering a unique and engaging gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Story &amp; Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where hope has vanished.<br>Chaos reigns. On the day the sky turned crimson, order collapsed, and trust among people was replaced by fear.<br>For reasons unknown, the skin of all mortals began to harden, and in their panic, they turned against one another.<br>You must gather those who still hold the will to return to their former selves, lead an expedition, and carve a new destiny.<br>Every choice you make will shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Expedition Management</strong> \u2013 Recruit and grow your units to form a unique, customized expedition team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/2ae444f8121545a603e5717c7a619c29.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover dangers and rewards as you delve into mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a98e90e152f02a79d8da6aa27731157a.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Secure your survival through lumbering, mining, and item crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a12ee816a88ea576b8b1134438c8797d.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in unpredictable, dice-based tactical battles that demand strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/83b4380bd3c26944a88262397d9d222f.avif?t=1755678732\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Development Intent &amp; Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brothers have deeply inspired me with their strategic depth and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 1 person team, I\u2019ve spent several years creating this game as a tribute to these exceptional title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will continue developing Ashen Dungeon to deliver its own unique and compelling experience, and I sincerely welcome your ongoing feedback and support.</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udcdc A world without hope\u2014Warriors defy fate in a desperate struggle! \ud83d\udc49 Assemble your expedition team, explore dungeons, and secure survival through logging &amp; mining. But fate will test you\u2014your choices shape destiny. &quot;\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fExpedition \ud83c\udf00Dungeon \u26cf\ufe0fFarming&amp;Crafting \u2694\ufe0fTurn Combat \ud83c\udfb2Dice Rule&quot;",
